    "title": "BackThen baby milestones album",
    "description": "BackThen is the perfect baby memory book app, photo & video app for your baby bump, baby growth during pregnancy pictures, and baby milestones.\r\n\r\nThis is the photo & video moments journal for proud parents. With BackThen, you can share your child\u2019s journey with loved ones and bring the family closer together. Track your pregnancy milestones with weekly baby bump photos, and record the important milestones to look back on later.\r\n\r\nHow can you use BackThen?\r\n\r\n1. As a milestone photo app: record the magical baby growth moments along your family\u2019s journey\r\n2. As a pregnancy photo moments app: track your pregnancy pictures over time as your bump grows\r\n3. As a baby photo diary app: a photo per day, week, or month to follow your baby\u2019s journey\r\n\r\nWhat can you expect from this photo & video app for parents and new parents?\r\n\r\n\u2022 Nothing complicated. Just photos and videos gallery on a beautiful timeline.\r\n\u2022 Simple, safe, and magically organized. Because parenting is busy enough.\r\n\u2022 Alive with comments, smiles and favorites.\r\n\u2022 Parents love it. Grandparents live for it. A private place just for family.\r\n\r\nGenerous for free users. Amazing for subscribers. Trusted by millions of families worldwide.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Enough free storage for tons of sharp photos and videos\r\n\u2022 Monthly VIP photobook subscription $4.99 / \u20ac4.49 / \u00a33.99\r\n\r\nQuestions? Send us a note to @backthenapp on Twitter or email support@backthen.app\r\nWhere\u2019s the small print? Terms of service: https://www.backthen.app/terms\r\nWe\u2019re nuts about privacy. Our lawyers\u2019 wordy translation: https://www.backthen.app/privacy\r\n\r\nBackThen memory book child tracker is kid photos, pic & video sharing app diary that keeps families together. Document child\u2019s precious journey, create art photo & video books.",
